  // R5a (2026-07-21) -- free-text grouping tag, not a relational category (PriceBookCategory's
  // hierarchical parent/child model is overkill for what's typically a few dozen org presets).
  // Nullable -- an uncategorized preset is valid, just not filterable by any chip.
